{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">● 甘南碌曲</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1699406982589.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在海拔3000+的高原牧区</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">卓玛草是这里唯一一名京东快递员</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">牧民频繁迁移的地址</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">常使下单地和送达地址相差十几公里</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">草场断断续续的信号</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">也让一通电话都变得困难</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">代牧民网购下单</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">帮村民顺手捎个货</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在卓玛草看来</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">尽可能满足好客户的需求</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">是她工作的最大意义</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">● 湛江硇洲岛</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1699407023976.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">带着&ldquo;岛外之岛&rdquo;的一份份快递</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">返岛大学生谭朝健</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">日复一日地驶过路桥、又跨过海湾</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">搭一小时一班的轮渡</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他把生活必需品带上岛</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">又将岛上的海鲜、农特产运出去</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">从一天二三十单到一趟两三百单</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他见证了小岛网购需求的增加</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">也感受着故土生活方式的变化</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">● 漠河北极村</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1699407058103.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在大兴安岭中散落着的</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">是我国最北的一片村落</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">间距远 - 隔着百十公里的林海是常态</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">气温低 - 比人更怕冷的是手机和电三轮车</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在一年有超八个月漫长雪季的漠河</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">尚祖峰是站点第一个</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">驱车八十公里给北极村送货的人</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">五年，从一个人到七个人</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">更多兄弟的加入让他相信</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他们可以把更多的村庄</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">跑通、连上</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1699407085753.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">恒⼼韧劲、务实笃⾏</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">像卓玛草、谭朝健、尚祖峰这样的</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">先锋故事⼀直在继续&hellip;&hellip;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">为了超预期的服务&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他们照亮敢为人先的前行之路</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">为了更省心的体验</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他们不以山海为远步履不停</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1699407106660.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01638", "contentTitle": "京东11.11｜先锋，京东红的故事", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1699406328000, "id": 3843, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1699407133770.jpg", "updateTime": 1704957030000}}